+// lineHoldsRule reports whether one line of the stored policy is the given
+// rule, comparing the parsed fields rather than the text so that a line the
+// caller wrote by hand matches the same rule that PolicyLineToCsv would emit.
+// Every matching line is dropped, not just the first: LoadPolicyLine skips a
+// duplicate rather than rejecting it, so a duplicate left behind would bring
+// the removed rule back on the next load.
+func lineHoldsRule(line string, target []string) bool {
